{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:6/67/sx8snt273pfvbjz9ycp97xqnjf00wol.mp3","text":"老板，安排点差事给我们吧~","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a2/f8i9p94v2qdlhyphidedfad7fki9v8n.mp3","text":"老板，不办个派对吗？来点嘻哈，再来点烤苹果派~完美的人生可是不能停止聚会的！No party，No life！","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7b/5t7mctjk58sbbn7005jqh02bn7or7o0.mp3","text":"子弹上膛，准备万全★老板，今天送点什么呀！","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/60/cwh1fyjnovf4rlbfmg5fkgyfll8vtv9.mp3","text":"有人认为只要有钱什么都能做到，不过在我这里可是行不通的哦。如果我要那个人安息，他有多少钱都没有用~","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:d/dd/ttby8h6q8o86gpg93av4m6tvu11q7cx.mp3","text":"第一个愿望！请送我八把铳当礼物！我们天使都有自己的守护铳，但只有一把可不够看！","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/84/ork5k4ihamhmliuyyhwv36aoibthblm.mp3","text":"第二个愿望......找个人把我头上这盏日光灯管关掉！","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9d/7xl8508hmon4qhgsdot1vu3kv98h1mf.mp3","text":"德克萨斯那家伙能活得这么潇洒，可多亏有我罩着她，这不是明摆着的事嘛~","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/da/mv8g5llx81x17sb6gubav588ygnrqq6.mp3","text":"如果您见到一名长着漆黑的角，散发着不祥气息的天使，请一定替我转告她：我从来没有忘记过她。","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/78/0hvydws7kzx4qyin9n6dz1jrgx6x2so.mp3","text":"老板，咱们企鹅物流还是挺不错的吧？要不要来当当我们的老大？欸嘿嘿~开玩笑的~","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2f/tmcovogpc2cl2ycft35smpych4hany1.mp3","text":"......主啊，这个人也是我们要拯救的吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:3/32/4vosoxu40ovzr8qje7gqujso65ip7if.mp3","text":"口令是“企鹅帝国万岁”，你就是雇主吗？叫我能天使。我和那个冷淡的鲁珀人可不一样，你要是想找点有趣的事做，随时都可以来叫我！","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fe/mmbg7au6bhbuqn419a819t0yycivbus.mp3","text":"我喜欢这种感觉！","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8a/mbaczx3fykwp10wdib8ytezk7k2w7m0.mp3","text":"老板，多谢提拔~","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:5/55/233o3rf9p2161rm0fz1y1jtbsnzexa7.mp3","text":"老板......不，义人，以手中的这把铳起誓，我将守护您的生命直至万物终结之日。","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:d/dc/ncgts9l9wk3blb5r2kc4d0j8c8g4tlc.mp3","text":"小组作战，我熟得很～","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d5/i3ezr8ece3x4hx1qnk3ozd8dgtexbeg.mp3","text":"没有比我更适合当队长的人！您真是别具慧眼！","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:5/56/t7ay7d80c5inhh2ndtd2m7w6so0eeas.mp3","text":"出发！让我们像风暴一样碾过去！","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:9/94/tdwjcquc9dwnnp3wa8rqntmiihid45o.mp3","text":"我帮你们预定了地狱黄金地段的房产，请放心！","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:7/75/efe93nq2teow0d7k38pomc6wd47gg2k.mp3","text":"好！","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/dd/58a1gd4rch6ymhkb1uc4j05k1b6lzup.mp3","text":"轮到我出场了吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b2/gjxr18qtgoy6dtiee0ns93n577e7yst.mp3","text":"跟我来！","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/bd/gzurzt89dgzmgs9unhzmjd7owxt8lu5.mp3","text":"让我来制造点混乱。","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:9/94/kb865f9xrfm0uq99wpm1mgntuxweago.mp3","text":"天意！","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/ac/llg82debdd97v6hrjw15048ed9rdhpc.mp3","text":"摇滚！","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/35/pxug0dm3hziqkj2k7y56di8q2rhmso8.mp3","text":"弹幕！","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/cb/nr040lb8btgoh42d7zdklv77scb6zni.mp3","text":"苹果派！","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:2/26/kenoi8sfnnezpjj98y8nnw32ies383v.mp3","text":"好！就照这个劲头向前冲！","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a7/4i92sdme9oqnp31vsi3shscsdl4smnl.mp3","text":"愿我的弹雨能熄灭你们的苦痛。","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bd/m7wr3mdepcfr5td5cnoghtu6746t5ri.mp3","text":"胜利的讯息即是甜蜜的福音。好~回去喝一杯吧！","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:2/26/m7613lwsanr795yjhm7b6we3505vxtb.mp3","text":"铳有卡壳的时候，人生也是如此，别介意别介意~","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:8/87/s17rwbyv239ktfy7jqflf4e13jldjqk.mp3","text":"我喜欢这个地方！","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:5/50/q3mopz02dtxlwu26r5la8b8w4k5qzzu.mp3","text":"哟！","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:9/90/lwcq39xff7vuh6900vd9xg0kldyl6xm.mp3","text":"老板！来试试我的武器吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/ngi286glspvc9afvcbrwwk1v7btagkb.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:e/eb/m7gc6oxm3gg624oyhuawhfwv2iad8on.mp3","text":"新年快乐啊，老板！派对就要开始了，业绩决战夜刚刚结束，我没有垫底~！这是您的酒和苹果派，让我们跟着嘻哈的节奏，一起炸了面前这座烟花塔吧~来，三、二、一——嘣！！","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:0/00/onq5nofqzhg4q1auwg8tmqrtxvjlzly.mp3","text":"哟，老板！","alt":"voice_cn/char_103_angel/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c0/aglder36o3r443066etq3532htmdxee.mp3","text":"老板，安排点差事给我们吧~","alt":"voice/char_103_angel/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:3/37/p67zck4l2us5vqhjwgpm34iudxwfujq.mp3","text":"老板，不办个派对吗？来点嘻哈，再来点烤苹果派~完美的人生可是不能停止聚会的！No party，No life！","alt":"voice/char_103_angel/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e4/9jiacctvumwre47qixhe45a1usee3f8.mp3","text":"子弹上膛，准备万全★老板，今天送点什么呀！","alt":"voice/char_103_angel/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3d/sszzughna8p2jlml39u4ic1b798trje.mp3","text":"有人认为只要有钱什么都能做到，不过在我这里可是行不通的哦。如果我要那个人安息，他有多少钱都没有用~","alt":"voice/char_103_angel/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3b/6w1qjjmox9y4e9e3ckr4t1osyk85trk.mp3","text":"第一个愿望！请送我八把铳当礼物！我们天使都有自己的守护铳，但只有一把可不够看！","alt":"voice/char_103_angel/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/df/alug8mwblm7wffeu5pam4rx062va0n0.mp3","text":"第二个愿望......找个人把我头上这盏日光灯管关掉！","alt":"voice/char_103_angel/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:1/15/sv9bymg76pup4bmnie2jjfu8k0gzetd.mp3","text":"德克萨斯那家伙能活得这么潇洒，可多亏有我罩着她，这不是明摆着的事嘛~","alt":"voice/char_103_angel/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/g0tsctikvpxzjnsxg7jhn53jr4mletb.mp3","tex